by Antoine Caillon and Philippe Esling, and from the acids-rave reference
implementation (IRCAM ACIDS):

  Caillon, A. & Esling, P. (2021). RAVE: A variational autoencoder for
  fast and high-quality neural audio synthesis. arXiv:2111.05011.
  https://github.com/acids-ircam/RAVE

